1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,060
Oh, my God.

2
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:44,240
Beware of false prophets who come to you

3
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:46,160
in sheep's clothing.

4
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:51,040
For inwardly, they are ravening wolves.

5
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:57,500
Jesus is the shepherd who protects
you and your family from those wolves.

6
00:00:58,360 --> 00:01:00,900
And I am his dog.

7
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:07,020
The sheepdog that get the lambs back
on track when they stray off the path.

8
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:13,200
And some of you have strayed, haven't you?

9
00:01:16,740 --> 00:01:17,940
What do you people think?

10
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:21,040
That God is well disposed towards you?

11
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:23,880
Let me set things straight.

12
00:01:25,020 --> 00:01:27,800
Those who deserve it go to hell.

13
00:01:29,540 --> 00:01:31,180
I could tell you about hell.

14
00:01:32,740 --> 00:01:34,040
About its flames.

15
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:36,540
About the pain.

16
00:01:38,580 --> 00:01:41,560
I'm sure you people have tried
to imagine what it's like.

17
00:01:44,780 --> 00:01:45,560
It's worse.

18
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,980
Retribution is coming.

19
00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:58,120
now let us join in singing abide with

20
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:58,380
me

21
00:02:20,540 --> 00:02:21,700
You all right?

22
00:02:27,660 --> 00:02:28,740
Thank you.

23
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:55,620
What do you do, sir? It's
my daughter, Sam, my boy,

24
00:02:55,780 --> 00:02:56,120
Matthew,

25
00:02:56,820 --> 00:02:59,860
and, uh, my wife.

26
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,340
Where were you?

27
00:03:13,620 --> 00:03:15,540
That man's a stranger here.

28
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,360
Doesn't know anybody yet.

29
00:03:18,220 --> 00:03:20,380
I'd expected a little
more compassion from you.

30
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,000
What's wrong? What's wrong?

31
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:23,360
What's wrong?

32
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:24,880
What's wrong? What's wrong?

33
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:25,620
What's wrong? What's wrong?

34
00:03:36,720 --> 00:03:39,360
It's okay. You're all right.

35
00:03:39,940 --> 00:03:41,020
Is there anything you can do?

36
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:43,340
Okay. All right. Just breathe, all right?

37
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:45,100
Just breathe. Just breathe.

38
00:03:45,100 --> 00:03:45,400
Ah!

39
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:46,960
Everybody outside.

40
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,780
We don't need no busybodies.

41
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,540
Go on, get. Get out!

42
00:03:54,700 --> 00:03:57,360
Nathan, I think you
better go outside, too.

43
00:03:58,100 --> 00:04:00,460
Some things aren't meant for a man's eyes.
